se AI in your daily work and can show how it helps you.</p></li></ul><p>Experience in market expansion or regulated industries is a plus. We’ll teach you what you need to know about compliance.</p><h2>What we offer</h2><ul><li><p>Competitive base salary, strong commission potential and opportunities to grow.</p></li><li><p>Fully remote work with flexible hours around shared core hours.</p></li><li><p>Apple equipment and modern software.</p></li><li><p>Close collaboration with the founders and the chance to shape our business in Italy.</p></li><li><p>Flat hierarchies and quick decisions.</p></li><li><p>A team where your opinion matters and you can make a difference.</p></li><li><p>The freedom to take responsibility and put your own ideas into practice.</p></li><li><p>The chance to help build an AI product as part of a dynamic, fast growing team</p></li></ul><p>Our headquarters are in Hamburg, and you’ll work remotely with the team. We’ll cover travel and accommodation for your initial onboarding and monthly team meetups.</p><p></p><p></p><h2></h2><p></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":true,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/logicc/gtm-manager-ai-startup-berlin-58998","tags":["Remote","Business Development"],"job_types":["Permanent employment","manager"],"location":"Berlin","created_at":1793048469},{"slug":"werkstudentin-influencer-ugc-marketing-purecha-kiel-85629","company_name":"Pure Beverage GmbH","title":"Werkstudent:in Influencer- & UGC-Marketing – Purēcha","description":"<h3>Werkstudent:in Influencer- & UGC-Marketing (m/w/d) – 15–20 Std./Woche, Kiel</h3><p>Du scrollst sowieso den ganzen Tag durch Reels und weißt, welche Creator wirklich Reichweite haben? Dann bau mit uns den Creator-Kanal für eine Marke auf, die gerade von der Café-Theke in die Küche zieht.</p><p><strong>Wer wir sind</strong></p><p>Purēcha ist unsere Latte-Konzentrat-Marke – Matcha