ile heavily leveraging the capabilities of AI models. All of us like to challenge ourselves and take real ownership over what we do, all while still staying humble and keeping a low-ego culture.<br /></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Check out our <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://principles.telli.com/"><strong>principles</strong></a> to see how we work.<br /><br /></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Mission</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are among the first enterprise BDRs at telli. You focus on generating pipeline for a voice AI product with massive market pull, then owning the full sales cycle as you grow. You'll shape our sales playbook and build the sales team that runs on it.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>what you’ll do:</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">generate qualified pipeline to help 10x telli’s revenue over the next year</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">identify the right prospects and engage with them</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">drive outreach across multiple channels including email, linkedin and phone</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">build and manage relationships with customers</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">develop into owning and closing deals end-to-end as early as after 6 months of great performance</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">manage pipeline and maintain CRM tooling</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">shape telli’s GTM motion, build a repeatable sales process &amp; refine outreach strategies<br /></p></li></ul><h2><strong>what makes you a great fit:</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">you have previous sales experience in startups or other fast-moving environments</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">you have consistently exceeded your targets or KPIs</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">you have strong business sense to understand problems and needs of different companies</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">you’re are hands-on and not afraid of doing unglamorous work</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">you’re a strong communicator in both English and German</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">you want to work with smart and friendly people with (self-reported) low ego</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">you want to work on-site 5 days a week in Berlin<br /></p></li></ul><h2><strong>you may </strong><em><strong>not</strong></em><strong> make a good fit if:</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">you need detailed instructions and shy away from taking responsibility</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">you lack basic product understanding</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">you're only interested in high-level "strategic" work</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">you don't enjoy direct customer interaction</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">you have never sold something</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">you prefer working remotely</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">you prefer working with minimal collaboration</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">you want to work a 9-5 job</p></li></ul><hr><p>Compensation: €75K – €85K</p><ul><li> • OTE (incl. commission) €75K – €85K</li></ul><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/telli/enterprise-business-development-representative-berlin-68185","tags":["GTM"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Berlin","created_at":1793040014},{"slug":"internship-g2m-stuttgart-353604","company_name":"Sereact GmbH","title":"Internship G2M (m/f/d)","description":"<h1><strong>Who We Are:</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">We build the intelligence that lets robots sense, reason, and act in the real world – not just in labs but in everyday industrial settings like warehouses and factories. Our technology helps closing automation gaps that traditional systems can’t solve. We’re on a mission to redefine how physical work gets done, and we’re looking for curious, bold thinkers to help shape the future of robotics with us.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>Overview</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are looking for a motivated, hands-on Intern (m/f/d) to support our sales and go-to-market team. This internship is ideal for students or early-stage professionals who are passionate about leveraging data to drive decision-making in a fast-paced, AI-driven environment. This role is highly operational and impact-driven: You will work at the intersection of sales, marketing, and operations to uncover trends, optimize CRM systems, and contribute to impactful initiatives that improve sales efficiency and effectiveness.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>Your Responsibilities</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Clean and standardize CRM records</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support Reporting for C-Level executives</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Improve data structure and maintain hygiene</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support ongoing CRM maintenance so reporting and sales execution stays reliable</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Research and prepare outbound initiatives for target accounts</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Create and maintain offer/proposal templates</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build a presentation library (deck modules, reusable slides, versioning/structure)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Organize case studies and documentation so sales and marketing can find and reuse content quickly</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support ad-hoc operational tasks that unblock the team and improve execution speed<br /></p></li></ul><h1><strong>Qualifications</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p