 and pipeline targets</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><h2>🤝 Your Skillset - What you bring to the table</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Several years in demand gen, growth marketing, or full-funnel B2B marketing, ideally in SaaS or tech</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hands-on experience with paid social, especially LinkedIn and Meta, from campaign setup to optimization</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong HubSpot knowledge: workflows, lead scoring, lifecycle stages, nurture programs, segmentation, and reporting</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong analytical mindset: you are comfortable with data, attribution, CAC, ROAS, conversion rates, and making decisions from it</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experimentation-first thinking: you have run A/B tests, documented learnings, and iterated based on results</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">AI-native mindset: you actively look for opportunities to automate repetitive work, build workflows, and know to use Claude co-work / Claude code to move faster and smarter</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ability to partner closely with Sales on lead quality, ICP alignment, MQL criteria, and pipeline targets</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">German ideally and English (our core market is DACH, most content is German)</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><h2>🌱 Growing together - what you can expect at voize</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Become a co-creator of our success with stock options</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are a fast-growing startup, that means you will tackle challenges, grow quickly, and make a real impact, giving frontline workers more time for people</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">We foster an open, collaborative culture with regular team events at our Berlin office, we offer hybrid work for this role with dedicated remote working days across the EU &a