ed by sales and the business team. </p><p><strong>Lead what comes next</strong>: With the CEO and CTO, you set the software direction and lead development of future products. </p><p><strong>Our stack:</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Backend:</strong> Python, FastAPI, PyTorch</p></li><li><p><strong>Frontend: </strong>React, TypeScript</p></li><li><p><strong>Hardware: </strong>C/C++, STM32 microcontrollers, Beckhoff PLCs</p></li><li><p><strong>Database: </strong>PostgreSQL (TimescaleDB)</p></li><li><p><strong>DevOps & Cloud: </strong>Linux, Docker, AWS, Grafana</p></li></ul><h2>What we are looking for</h2><p><strong>Required:</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Education</strong>: MSc or PhD in Computer Science, Robotics, Electrical or Mechanical Engineering, or similar.</p></li><li><p><strong>Python</strong>: This is a must. You write clean Python that runs in production, on real systems.</p></li><li><p><strong>Embedded & Hardware: </strong>Shipped C/C++ on microcontrollers running on physical hardware; comfortable working with sensors, actuators, and basic electronics.  </p></li><li><p><strong>Applied AI & Control:</strong> Understanding of modern control and ML/RL methods, with hands-on PyTorch experience applied to physical or dynamic systems.</p></li><li><p><strong>Cloud & data</strong>: You are comfortable with PostgreSQL, Docker and AWS.</p></li><li><p><strong>Leadership attitude</strong>: You take ownership, make decisions, and want to grow as a leader.</p></li><li><p><strong>Languages</strong>: English. German is a big plus.</p></li><li><p><strong>Hybrid setting</strong>: You will be expected to be on-site at least three days per week, and sometimes at customers’ locations, to work on real products.</p></li><li><p><strong>Availability</strong>: 100%, as soon as possible.</p></li><li><p><strong>Work-permit: </strong>You need the right to work in Switzerland for this position.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Preferred:</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Startup experience: </str