trol and brand alignment.</p></li></ul><p></p><h2><strong>Working Environment & Expectations</strong></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Execution Velocity:</strong> We prioritize shipping experiments quickly, learning from real-world data, and iterating fast.</p></li><li><p><strong>Tooling Ownership & Independence:</strong> You will have complete autonomy over our stack. We expect you to proactively recommend and implement the best modern automation and AI solutions. You define the tools you need to win.</p></li><li><p><strong>Asynchronous Communication:</strong> Clear documentation, meticulous task tracking, and transparent status updates are core to how we work, allowing you to manage your own time effectively.</p></li></ul><p></p><h2><strong>Why join Papers?</strong></h2><ul><li><p>Work with cutting-edge technology that actually matters with a team that is obsessed with redefining what cutting edge means.</p></li><li><p>High ownership, low bureaucracy. Your voice drives the strategy, giving you the independence to define your own processes.</p></li><li><p>Influence the Growth strategy from day one.</p></li><li><p>Competitive compensation structure tied directly to your impact, with clear pathways for career growth.</p></li><li><p>25 days paid vacation per year.</p></li><li><p>Regular team events and retreats (at least quarterly).</p></li><li><p>Support for your ongoing learning and development.r</p></li></ul><p></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.ch/jobs/companies/papers-ag/growth-ai-marketing-operations-specialist-zug-251104","tags":["Online Marketing"],"job_types":["Indefinite contract (unbefristeter arbeitsvertrag)","professional / experienced"],"location":"Zug","created_at":1792744269},{"slug":"automatisierungsingenieurin-dietlikon-148100","company_name":"cross-ING AG","title":"Automatisierungsingenieur:in","description":"<p><span 