trategy and performance across our key markets and prepare the channel for Hilo’s next stage of growth. Creative strategy is a core driver of paid social performance: You turn customer insight and campaign data into compelling concepts, run a rigorous testing program and work with creative partners to bring the strongest ideas to market. </p><p>You connect that work to measurable business outcomes, improving conversion and return on investment while making sure every health claim is accurate and approved.</p><p>Reporting to the Head of Performance Marketing, you will play a key role in our performance marketing team, working with internal teams and external partners to drive growth.</p><p>Work location: Our company operates on a remote-first model. This role can be performed remotely from anywhere in Europe. Fluent English and German are a must. Occasional travel to our office in Neuchâtel, Switzerland, or to team events may be required.<br></p><h3><u><strong>Core responsibilities</strong></u></h3><ul><li>Lead paid social strategy, planning and execution across the US, UK, Germany and other growth markets.</li><li>Develop creative hypotheses based on customer research, market differences and performance data.</li><li>Brief, test and refine ad concepts, messages, formats and landing pages in partnership with creative and product teams.</li><li>Manage campaign budgets, audiences and optimisation across Meta, TikTok and other relevant platforms.</li><li>Identify opportunities to improve the customer journey and conversion rate, from ad click through to purchase.</li><li>Measure performance against acquisition cost, revenue and return on investment and turn findings into clear decisions and next steps.</li><li>Work with clinical, regulatory and legal colleagues to ensure advertising claims and health messaging are accurate and approved.</li><li>Steer agencies and freelancers, set clear priorities and ensure high-quality execution and continuous performance improvement.<